{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17540","headline":"奉酬礼部阁老转韵离合见赠 · 张荐","name":"奉酬礼部阁老转韵离合见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移居既同里，多幸陪君子。\n弘雅重当朝，弓旌早见招。\n植根琼林圃，直夜金闺步。\n劝深子玉铭，力竞相如赋。\n间阔向春闱，日复想光仪。\n格言信难继，木石强爲词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张荐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}